141
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,750
Le Xiaotao!

142
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:15,150
No.

143
00:11:16,030 --> 00:11:17,270
You have to tell the truth.

144
00:11:17,270 --> 00:11:19,120
Exactly. Lying is bad.

145
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:20,870
I'll ask again.

146
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:22,910
Is there or not?

147
00:11:24,910 --> 00:11:25,870
No.

148
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,750
You're pressing down on my hand too hard.

149
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:33,550
You obviously just got shocked.

150
00:11:34,670 --> 00:11:36,440
There's no current in this at all.

151
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,910
It's just a toy I bought online

152
00:11:37,910 --> 00:11:39,150
for a few dozen yuan.

153
00:11:39,150 --> 00:11:40,380
How can you take it seriously?

154
00:11:40,380 --> 00:11:42,310
That's not what you said last time.

155
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:44,030
Anyway,

156
00:11:44,630 --> 00:11:46,690
this is just meant to liven things up.

157
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:47,910
Alright, you pass.

158
00:11:47,910 --> 00:11:48,630
Next round.

159
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:49,840
One, two...

160
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:50,390
Three.

161
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,150
Three.

162
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:56,080
-Gu Han.
-Do you choose Truth or...

163
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:56,870
Dare.

164
00:11:56,870 --> 00:11:58,330
I'll come up with the Dare!

165
00:11:58,670 --> 00:11:59,320
Come on.

166
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:01,970
Do 3 squats while holding Xiangxiang.

167
00:12:02,670 --> 00:12:04,360
-Nice one.
-Le Xiaotao!

168
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:05,720
Rules are rules.

169
00:12:07,270 --> 00:12:07,960
Come on.

170
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:10,480
-Go.
-Come on, go.

171
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:11,240
Come on.

172
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:12,620
-You can do it! Go.
-Hurry!

173
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:13,500
Come on.

174
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:18,560
Dare! Dare! Dare!

175
00:12:18,580 --> 00:12:21,550
Dare! Dare! Dare!

176
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:23,080
Hurry up, hurry up!

177
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:24,970
Isn't 3 squats a little too few?

178
00:12:25,870 --> 00:12:26,910
-Hurry up.
-Come on!

179
00:12:26,910 --> 00:12:27,960
-Hurry up!
-Hurry!

180
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,350
-We're all waiting!
-Dare!

181
00:12:29,350 --> 00:12:32,440
Dare! Dare! Dare!

182
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,630
A princess carry!

183
00:12:34,630 --> 00:12:35,000
Not bad. Come on.

184
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:35,630
Steady yourself first. Come on.

185
00:12:35,630 --> 00:12:36,550
One.

186
00:12:36,570 --> 00:12:37,600
One.

187
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:39,150
Two.

188
00:12:39,550 --> 00:12:40,960
Three.

189
00:12:43,390 --> 00:12:44,630
Not bad.

190
00:12:47,870 --> 00:12:48,960
Okay, pass.

191
00:12:49,910 --> 00:12:52,600
Come on, one, two, three.

192
00:12:52,750 --> 00:12:53,390
Okay, I'll ask Chen Yu.

193
00:12:53,390 --> 00:12:54,320
Go ahead and ask.

194
00:12:56,970 --> 00:12:59,970
Chen Yu, how long have you
had a secret crush on Youyou?

195
00:12:59,970 --> 00:13:01,620
-Shut up.
-Shut it.

196
00:13:01,640 --> 00:13:02,900
Fine, then just drink.

197
00:13:05,030 --> 00:13:05,910
Come on, cheers!

198
00:13:05,910 --> 00:13:07,770
Come on, have a drink with Youyou.

199
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:12,970
-Are you drinking or not?
-Why are you making such a fuss?

200
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:14,850
I'm going to the restroom.

201
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:26,340
Make sure you take her back later.

202
00:13:48,510 --> 00:13:49,510
We're at the dorm.

203
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:17,810
♪ Time circles round, going nowhere ♪

204
00:14:19,710 --> 00:14:23,850
♪ We once met, then passed each other by ♪

205
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:32,310
♪ Eyes closed, memories quietly unfold ♪

206
00:14:26,510 --> 00:14:27,320
Xiangxiang,

207
00:14:28,240 --> 00:14:29,900
you should head upstairs now.

208
00:14:34,280 --> 00:14:38,680
♪ Every story will unfold ♪

209
00:14:41,390 --> 00:14:47,800
♪ I look up again,
the sleepless stars in sight ♪

210
00:14:46,850 --> 00:14:47,730
Gu Han.

211
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:52,710
♪ So this is what it means to miss you ♪

212
00:14:53,020 --> 00:15:01,390
♪ I want you to say those words at last ♪

213
00:14:54,870 --> 00:14:56,030
I hate you.

214
00:15:02,590 --> 00:15:07,100
♪ Love means being with you ♪

215
00:15:07,550 --> 00:15:10,440
♪ I love you ♪

216
00:15:10,930 --> 00:15:14,330
♪ I miss you ♪

217
00:15:14,990 --> 00:15:22,170
♪ The me who met you that day
belongs to long, long ago ♪

218
00:15:22,490 --> 00:15:25,670
♪ Across the sea of time ♪

219
00:15:26,090 --> 00:15:30,600
♪ Reunited,
love finds its sweetest scene ♪

220
00:15:30,730 --> 00:15:38,140
♪ Loving you, I'll never change ♪

221
00:15:43,860 --> 00:15:47,150
[Jiangcheng University]

222
00:16:01,320 --> 00:16:02,650
Captain, where are you?

223
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:04,320
Why aren't you at the gym yet?

224
00:16:18,510 --> 00:16:21,010
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

225
00:16:32,310 --> 00:16:36,900
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

226
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:33,790
Are you okay?

227
00:16:35,030 --> 00:16:35,960
Are you awake?

228
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:42,330
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

229
00:17:01,660 --> 00:17:03,190
My head hurts so much.

230
00:17:03,510 --> 00:17:06,569
Who wouldn't have a headache
after drinking that much?

231
00:17:09,270 --> 00:17:11,440
Do you remember how you got back?

232
00:17:12,750 --> 00:17:14,069
How else?

233
00:17:14,550 --> 00:17:16,720
Didn't I come back with you all?

234
00:17:16,829 --> 00:17:18,880
Gu Han brought you back.

235
00:17:19,829 --> 00:17:21,510
He brought me back?

236
00:17:21,589 --> 00:17:23,680
Who else would it be?
Do you think everyone is like you,

237
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:25,109
taking people to hotels?

238
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:27,640
That's a bit too much, isn't it?

239
00:17:27,640 --> 00:17:28,240
What's wrong?

240
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:28,960
Look.

241
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:31,440
"Don't hide behind the screen.

242
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:33,920
If you have the guts, come meet me
face-to-face tonight at Langting Park."

243
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:35,030
He's always got something to say.

244
00:17:35,030 --> 00:17:37,030
I'll go. You think I'm afraid of you?

245
00:17:37,070 --> 00:17:40,000
Youyou, it's not safe off-campus.
We'll go with you.

246
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:57,070
Is it her?

247
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:06,680
Weirdos.

248
00:18:11,430 --> 00:18:12,940
I was nervous.

249
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:16,510
Take this.

250
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:17,680
Okay.

251
00:18:17,750 --> 00:18:19,270
If anything goes wrong,
just sound the alarm!

252
00:18:19,270 --> 00:18:20,480
Everyone around will hear it!

253
00:18:20,480 --> 00:18:21,000
Okay.

254
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:23,000
A-And then we'll find somewhere to...

255
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:25,930
-We'll be watching you from over there.
-Over there!

256
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:26,960
We'll wait for you there.

257
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,110
Let's go, let's go.

258
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:44,350
Where will they be coming from?

259
00:18:44,350 --> 00:18:45,240
No idea.

260
00:18:47,510 --> 00:18:49,070
Will this work?

261
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:51,350
No idea.

262
00:18:52,590 --> 00:18:53,480
It's fine.

263
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:55,920
Mine seems okay.

264
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:58,660
-Where did you get them?
-Where did you get them?

265
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:01,640
I think it's them.

266
00:19:09,550 --> 00:19:10,430
Youyou...

267
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:11,590
Youyou!

268
00:19:11,590 --> 00:19:12,790
-Youyou!
-Youyou!

269
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:14,070
-Youyou!
-Youyou!

270
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:15,260
-Youyou!
-Youyou!

271
00:19:15,260 --> 00:19:16,350
Yu You, run!

272
00:19:16,550 --> 00:19:17,240
Run!

273
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:18,550
-Youyou!
-Run!

274
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:25,160
After them!

275
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:26,800
Don't run!

276
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:36,200
Where did they go?

277
00:19:36,590 --> 00:19:37,480
Let's go look over there.

278
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:38,110
Let's go.

279
00:19:39,750 --> 00:19:41,440
Did you see where Youyou went?

280
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:43,680
Why are there
2 different groups of people?

281
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:45,480
Could she have been kidnapped?

282
00:19:45,750 --> 00:19:47,880
No, I need to call the police right now.

283
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:50,350
[The Liberal Arts Fab Four]

284
00:19:49,030 --> 00:19:50,830
I'm fine now. You can all go back.

285
00:19:51,160 --> 00:19:52,440
She's fine now.

286
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:56,510
What's going on?

287
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:03,970
They didn't follow us here.

288
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:11,350
How about...

289
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:13,160
we go back first?

290
00:20:13,590 --> 00:20:14,400
Okay.

291
00:20:23,030 --> 00:20:24,760
Senior, how did you end up here?

292
00:20:25,750 --> 00:20:27,270
I was scrolling through Weibo

293
00:20:27,270 --> 00:20:30,600
and happened to see you
arguing with a hater in the comments.

294
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:32,270
"Happened to"?

295
00:20:35,880 --> 00:20:36,940
Thank you, Senior.

296
00:20:37,510 --> 00:20:38,640
You're welcome.

297
00:20:38,830 --> 00:20:40,590
As guys,

298
00:20:40,680 --> 00:20:41,880
at times like this...

299
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:42,830
What was that?

300
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:44,270
What was that?

301
00:20:46,510 --> 00:20:47,830
It's just a cat.

302
00:20:51,350 --> 00:20:52,160
A cat.

303
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:57,070
I'm sorry.

304
00:21:00,030 --> 00:21:00,880
Let's go.

305
00:21:09,510 --> 00:21:10,680
Alright, spill it.

306
00:21:10,680 --> 00:21:13,310
Who's the knight in shining armor
who rescued you?

307
00:21:13,310 --> 00:21:15,790
You made us so worried
that we almost called the police,

308
00:21:15,790 --> 00:21:18,160
and here you are,
just smiling without saying a word.

309
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:20,000
Alright, I'll tell you.

310
00:21:20,310 --> 00:21:21,240
It was Chen Yu.

311
00:21:22,270 --> 00:21:23,350
Chen Yu?

312
00:21:24,480 --> 00:21:25,920
He finally made a move.

313
00:21:25,920 --> 00:21:27,160
He was the first one
to rush over and carry you

314
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:28,920
to the hospital during the sports meet.

315
00:21:28,920 --> 00:21:31,480
He's been asking about you
at the gym all along.

316
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:35,340
And at Li Sirui's housewarming party,
he was sneaking glances at you!

317
00:21:35,480 --> 00:21:36,960
Enough about me.

318
00:21:37,240 --> 00:21:40,440
There is someone
who hasn't been questioned yet.

319
00:21:41,590 --> 00:21:42,720
Xiangxiang,

320
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:43,350
come on.

321
00:21:43,440 --> 00:21:44,240
What?

322
00:21:45,920 --> 00:21:47,880
What exactly happened last night?

323
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:52,200
I really drank too much last night.

324
00:21:52,200 --> 00:21:53,510
I don't remember anything.

325
00:21:53,510 --> 00:21:56,040
The next thing I knew,
it was already morning.

326
00:21:56,110 --> 00:21:57,720
Who would believe that?

327
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:58,720
Exactly.

328
00:21:58,720 --> 00:22:00,380
A guy and a girl alone together

329
00:22:00,720 --> 00:22:02,310
after drinking, and nothing happened?

330
00:22:02,310 --> 00:22:03,310
What do you mean? Nothing happened!

331
00:22:03,310 --> 00:22:05,240
How could anything have happened?

332
00:22:08,400 --> 00:22:09,930
Excuse me, coming through.

333
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:17,880
Alright.

334
00:22:18,310 --> 00:22:19,570
Everyone, break it up.

335
00:22:37,550 --> 00:22:39,270
I've gathered everyone here today

336
00:22:39,270 --> 00:22:40,960
to share some good news.

337
00:22:40,380 --> 00:22:42,500
[The Starry Sky Host Recruitment Plan]

338
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:42,790
The Starry Sky's popular basketball show

339
00:22:42,790 --> 00:22:43,960
"24 Seconds"

340
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:45,510
is recruiting female intern streamers

341
00:22:45,510 --> 00:22:47,200
from major universities.

342
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:50,480
Our university has also been invited,

343
00:22:50,600 --> 00:22:52,060
but there is only one spot.

344
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:53,000
Senior,

345
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:55,720
how will the selection process work?

346
00:22:56,160 --> 00:22:58,480
The website's judges
will conduct interviews

347
00:22:58,480 --> 00:22:59,790
and select the candidates.

348
00:22:59,790 --> 00:23:01,720
There will be a basketball knowledge Q&A

349
00:23:01,720 --> 00:23:03,270
and a scripted broadcast.

350
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:05,160
If you perform well,

351
00:23:05,160 --> 00:23:06,160
you might even have the chance to become

352
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:08,030
one of their official streamers later on.

353
00:23:08,030 --> 00:23:09,350
I'll hand out

354
00:23:09,350 --> 00:23:11,750
the detailed recruitment plan in a moment.

355
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:13,830
I hope you all do well

356
00:23:13,830 --> 00:23:14,880
in the selection.

357
00:23:18,730 --> 00:23:27,030
[JCU Campus TV Station]

358
00:23:24,030 --> 00:23:24,960
Xiangxiang!

359
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:28,720
I was just looking for you.

360
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:29,520
What's wrong?

361
00:23:30,310 --> 00:23:31,720
Li Sirui just told me

362
00:23:31,720 --> 00:23:32,920
they had played a warm-up match

363
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:34,640
against the Jinhao Youth Team.

364
00:23:34,640 --> 00:23:37,070
Gu Han was heavily targeted
by their defense throughout the game

365
00:23:37,070 --> 00:23:38,350
and got injured.

366
00:23:39,110 --> 00:23:40,310
Really?

367
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:42,420
You're not messing with me again, are you?

368
00:23:42,420 --> 00:23:43,690
It's true.

369
00:23:43,960 --> 00:23:45,420
You should go check on him.

370
00:23:45,590 --> 00:23:46,400
If I'm lying,

371
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:48,200
I'll do your laundry for a month.

372
00:23:51,830 --> 00:23:54,190
His injury
has nothing to do with me, though.

373
00:23:53,820 --> 00:24:03,350
[JCU Campus TV Station]

374
00:23:55,680 --> 00:23:57,480
I heard it's his knee.

375
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:59,700
Li Sirui had to help him off the court.

376
00:24:00,400 --> 00:24:02,750
I wonder if he can walk properly
on his own.

377
00:24:17,960 --> 00:24:20,070
Maybe we should get the team doctor
to take a look.

378
00:24:20,070 --> 00:24:20,750
No need.

379
00:24:24,880 --> 00:24:25,510
Tian,

380
00:24:26,070 --> 00:24:26,750
I'm sorry.

381
00:24:27,440 --> 00:24:28,840
I didn't play well today.

382
00:24:30,270 --> 00:24:31,070
It's fine.

383
00:24:31,750 --> 00:24:32,850
The whole point of this game

384
00:24:32,850 --> 00:24:33,920
was to see how big the gap

385
00:24:33,920 --> 00:24:35,790
is between you and the professional teams.

386
00:24:35,790 --> 00:24:37,320
Get some proper rest today.

387
00:24:37,480 --> 00:24:39,280
We'll review the game tomorrow.

388
00:24:42,480 --> 00:24:44,240
Captain, put ice packs on it.

389
00:24:44,540 --> 00:24:45,400
Give them to me.

390
00:24:53,310 --> 00:24:54,110
Tian,

391
00:24:54,510 --> 00:24:56,770
why don't you guys go back and rest first?

392
00:24:57,070 --> 00:24:58,240
Give Gu Han a moment.

393
00:25:01,790 --> 00:25:02,480
Okay.

394
00:25:03,550 --> 00:25:04,480
Let's head back first

395
00:25:04,480 --> 00:25:05,200
and give him some space.

396
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:06,000
Okay.

397
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:08,070
Captain, get some good rest.

398
00:25:17,890 --> 00:25:19,490
Here, let me apply it for you.

399
00:25:19,720 --> 00:25:20,720
I'll do it myself.

400
00:25:26,270 --> 00:25:27,720
What's wrong?

401
00:25:28,000 --> 00:25:30,400
Didn't I always help you with this before?

402
00:25:31,960 --> 00:25:34,590
I just want to spend some time with you.

403
00:25:42,200 --> 00:25:42,960
Tang Hui.

404
00:25:44,960 --> 00:25:47,000
Could you please avoid doing things

405
00:25:47,750 --> 00:25:50,480
that might give people
the wrong idea from now on?

406
00:25:52,750 --> 00:25:54,160
I already told you

407
00:25:54,400 --> 00:25:56,550
the last time we had dinner with Bai Xue.

408
00:25:56,550 --> 00:25:57,400
I've only ever

409
00:25:58,400 --> 00:26:00,600
seen you as the little sister next door,

410
00:26:00,960 --> 00:26:02,270
just a friend.

411
00:26:03,550 --> 00:26:04,270
Okay?

412
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:13,800
Does what happened in childhood

413
00:26:14,400 --> 00:26:15,830
really matter that much?

414
00:26:16,960 --> 00:26:18,680
Maybe back then, it was just...

415
00:26:18,680 --> 00:26:20,000
I've never forgotten.

416
00:26:30,200 --> 00:26:31,590
What if it had been me?

417
00:26:33,270 --> 00:26:34,550
What if I had been

418
00:26:34,550 --> 00:26:36,010
the first girl you ever met

419
00:26:36,880 --> 00:26:38,200
in your life?

420
00:26:41,030 --> 00:26:42,830
This isn't about who came first.

421
00:26:43,790 --> 00:26:44,920
She is who she is.

422
00:26:45,180 --> 00:26:46,710
No one can ever replace her.

423
00:27:08,550 --> 00:27:10,070
Then get some good rest.

424
00:27:40,660 --> 00:27:40,830
[Yunnan Baiyao]

425
00:27:42,080 --> 00:27:44,120
[Far-Infrared Therapy Patch]

426
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:15,310
But that girl isn't Tang Hui.

427
00:28:15,720 --> 00:28:16,960
Then who could it be?

428
00:28:24,940 --> 00:28:27,510
[The Starry Sky]

429
00:28:26,200 --> 00:28:27,240
Ms. Wan, this way.

430
00:28:27,720 --> 00:28:28,830
Ms. Wan, your sponsorship

431
00:28:28,830 --> 00:28:30,240
of this basketball project

432
00:28:30,240 --> 00:28:32,300
has given us tremendous confidence.

433
00:28:33,070 --> 00:28:35,440
Basketball itself has great potential,

434
00:28:35,920 --> 00:28:38,200
and it's extremely popular
on university campuses.

435
00:28:38,200 --> 00:28:40,600
What interests me is its commercial value.

436
00:28:41,200 --> 00:28:42,510
I'd say I know a bit about basketball.

437
00:28:42,510 --> 00:28:45,370
My son plays for
his university's basketball team.

438
00:28:45,790 --> 00:28:47,320
Does your son want to go pro?

439
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:50,350
It's more of a hobby for him.

440
00:28:51,480 --> 00:28:53,940
He's majoring in business administration.

441
00:28:54,160 --> 00:28:55,110
That's good too.

442
00:28:55,310 --> 00:28:59,040
Actually, being a professional
basketball player is a tough road.

443
00:29:00,440 --> 00:29:01,400
Yes.

444
00:29:09,590 --> 00:29:10,110
Ms. Wan,

445
00:29:10,110 --> 00:29:11,920
these are the profiles
of some campus streamers

446
00:29:11,920 --> 00:29:14,410
we've selected
for the upcoming basketball event.

447
00:29:14,410 --> 00:29:15,120
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

448
00:29:15,150 --> 00:29:16,390
[Education]

449
00:29:16,410 --> 00:29:17,460
[Project Experience]

450
00:29:18,440 --> 00:29:20,030
Zhou Xiangxiang...

451
00:29:22,310 --> 00:29:24,060
[Sifang Heyi Restaurant]

452
00:29:30,550 --> 00:29:31,310
Auntie.

453
00:29:31,440 --> 00:29:32,310
Xiangxiang.

454
00:29:33,310 --> 00:29:34,110
I'm sorry

455
00:29:34,110 --> 00:29:35,960
for asking you to meet me so suddenly.

456
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:36,680
It's fine.

457
00:29:36,890 --> 00:29:38,240
I don't have any classes today anyway.

458
00:29:38,240 --> 00:29:40,040
Come on, let's eat while we talk.

459
00:29:40,200 --> 00:29:41,400
I can do it myself.

460
00:29:41,400 --> 00:29:42,200
You eat too.

461
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:45,960
Xiangxiang.

462
00:29:46,310 --> 00:29:47,510
Let me ask you something.

463
00:29:47,510 --> 00:29:48,310
When you were little,

464
00:29:48,310 --> 00:29:50,510
did you live in the Wanfu Road compound?

465
00:29:50,920 --> 00:29:53,030
How did you know I lived on Wanfu Road?

466
00:29:53,550 --> 00:29:55,400
I was your neighbor in that compound.

467
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:56,440
I'm your Auntie Wan.

468
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:57,480
Auntie Wan?

469
00:29:59,960 --> 00:30:00,640
Back then,

470
00:30:00,640 --> 00:30:02,830
our family lived right next door to yours.

471
00:30:02,830 --> 00:30:04,720
You used to come over
to play with Gu Han a lot.

472
00:30:04,720 --> 00:30:05,980
Do you still remember?

473
00:30:09,310 --> 00:30:11,750
Right, back then his name
was still Gu Xiaoli.

474
00:30:11,750 --> 00:30:13,590
You were always following him around,

475
00:30:13,590 --> 00:30:14,850
calling him "Xiaoli."

476
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:17,000
You mean...

477
00:30:17,750 --> 00:30:20,000
Gu Han is Xiaoli?

478
00:30:20,400 --> 00:30:21,720
I remember that back then,

479
00:30:21,720 --> 00:30:23,960
his dad and I were always busy
with business trips

480
00:30:23,960 --> 00:30:25,270
and restocking inventory,

481
00:30:25,270 --> 00:30:26,960
leaving him home alone.

482
00:30:27,920 --> 00:30:30,720
Thankfully, your parents
helped take care of him.

483
00:30:31,160 --> 00:30:32,640
When we finished our work and came back,

484
00:30:32,640 --> 00:30:35,170
seeing how happily
Gu Han was playing with you

485
00:30:35,240 --> 00:30:36,840
always put our minds at ease.

486
00:30:37,880 --> 00:30:40,400
Isn't it amazing how fate works sometimes?

487
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:41,440
Who would've thought that you two

488
00:30:41,440 --> 00:30:44,900
would meet again at the same university
all these years later?

489
00:30:45,070 --> 00:30:47,200
Didn't Gu Han ever tell you about this?

490
00:30:50,200 --> 00:30:51,480
Maybe it's been so long

491
00:30:51,480 --> 00:30:52,940
that even he's forgotten.

492
00:30:55,640 --> 00:30:56,970
There is one I yearn for,

493
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:58,900
so near, yet we are strangers.

494
00:30:59,550 --> 00:31:00,950
There is a sorrow I carry,

495
00:31:01,240 --> 00:31:02,900
tangled deep within my heart.

496
00:31:02,960 --> 00:31:04,070
What if...

497
00:31:04,640 --> 00:31:05,900
she hadn't been there?

498
00:31:06,270 --> 00:31:07,550
What if I had been

499
00:31:07,550 --> 00:31:09,010
the first girl you ever met

500
00:31:09,790 --> 00:31:11,000
in your life?

501
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:13,800
This isn't about who came first.

502
00:31:14,920 --> 00:31:16,030
She is who she is.

503
00:31:17,000 --> 00:31:18,530
No one can ever replace her.

504
00:31:20,480 --> 00:31:21,750
He hasn't forgotten.

505
00:31:22,110 --> 00:31:25,240
He's always kept
his childhood sweetheart in his heart.

506
00:31:25,350 --> 00:31:27,350
If that person isn't Tang Hui,

507
00:31:27,350 --> 00:31:29,000
could it be...

508
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:31,310
Come on, Xiangxiang.

509
00:31:31,750 --> 00:31:32,400
Eat up.

510
00:31:33,310 --> 00:31:34,040
Xiangxiang?

511
00:31:35,880 --> 00:31:37,880
Was it a bit sudden, hearing all that

512
00:31:38,000 --> 00:31:39,070
at once?

513
00:31:39,400 --> 00:31:40,110
No.

514
00:31:40,920 --> 00:31:42,960
How are your parents doing now?

515
00:31:43,200 --> 00:31:44,330
They're doing well.

516
00:31:44,790 --> 00:31:46,920
How have you been since you moved here?

517
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:50,960
Well, after we moved here,

518
00:31:51,070 --> 00:31:52,240
his father and I

519
00:31:52,440 --> 00:31:54,100
turned out to be incompatible

520
00:31:54,200 --> 00:31:55,530
and argued constantly.

521
00:31:56,240 --> 00:31:57,640
Later, we got divorced.

522
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:01,160
Auntie Wan,

523
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:04,100
Senior just seems
a bit aloof on the outside,

524
00:32:04,440 --> 00:32:06,700
but I'm sure he cares about you deep down.

525
00:32:07,790 --> 00:32:09,400
You've seen it yourself, Xiangxiang.

526
00:32:09,400 --> 00:32:11,860
The two of us just
can't seem to communicate.

527
00:32:18,400 --> 00:32:20,730
Actually, his birthday is coming up soon.

528
00:32:20,960 --> 00:32:22,820
You could celebrate it together.

529
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:26,460
Sometimes, it's easier
to talk things through face-to-face.

530
00:32:26,680 --> 00:32:27,830
He hasn't celebrated his birthday

531
00:32:27,830 --> 00:32:29,200
with me in years.

532
00:32:32,030 --> 00:32:32,790
Then...

533
00:32:33,480 --> 00:32:34,550
celebrate it together this year.
